+modes.
+The release gives the toggler icon a second value under its dark component rule as well. Veneer
+declares that value on the icon's own rule, so an icon under any dark scope, a nested light island
+included, takes the dark icon, and the dark scope itself declares no icon.
+
+The toggler's focus ring is the recorded shadow in the toggler's own text color, at the
+`--bs-navbar-toggler-focus-width` spread, and it answers to the `:focus` pseudo-class as the release
